For `n ≥ n₀`, with `b = lg n`, every atom the setup expressions read is at most `A = 2^{b+2}`.
The expressions have degree at most `8`, so all values have fewer than `B = 8b+17` bits
(`KFMSm`). This gives

* **`setupA_cost`**, **`setupB_cost`**, **`setupC_cost`**: each at most `10^15 (b+1)^4`.
-/

